{"id":"2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to","date":"2026-11-05","topic":"apps","region":"americas","headline":"Steve Jobs Returned to Lead Apple After Being Fired","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steve_Jobs"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Steve Jobs started Apple with Steve Wozniak in 1976.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.77,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":7.36,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.7,1.18,1.64,2.02,2.32,3.02,3.28]},{"text":"He left Apple after a power fight in 1985.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":5.42,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.26,0.62,1.1,1.26,1.46,1.88,2.12]},{"text":"Jobs created a new computer company named NeXT.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.34,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.42,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.64,0.96,1.2,1.66,2.12,2.46]},{"text":"He also bought a graphics group that became Pixar.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","S","V","C"],"dur":2.68,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.28,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.18,0.54,0.7,0.98,1.46,1.66,1.88]},{"text":"Apple bought NeXT and Jobs returned in 1997.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","S","V","M","M"],"dur":4.02,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.94,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,1.04,1.36,1.6,2.0,2.48]}],"bands":{"core1000":91,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":6,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"with Steve Wozniak","title":"Prepositional Phrase as Modifier","note":"The preposition 'with' introduces companion detail to the main action. It modifies the verb phrase by showing who joined the founder."},{"i":3,"focus":"that became Pixar","title":"Relative Clause with 'That'","note":"The pronoun 'that' connects a describing clause to the noun 'group'. Inside this relative clause, 'that' functions as the subject."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"Steve Jobs co-founded Apple, but he lost a power struggle in 1985.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":5.46,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.79,"times":[0.0,0.42,0.8,1.64,2.46,2.66,2.78,3.06,3.28,3.46,3.98,4.2]},{"text":"The board of directors removed him, so he left the company.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","M","S","V","O","O"],"dur":3.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":4.26,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.32,0.46,0.78,1.28,1.94,2.04,2.22,2.44,2.68]},{"text":"He started NeXT and he bought a computer graphics group named Pixar.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.41,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":5.99,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,1.02,1.56,1.68,1.86,2.0,2.38,2.78,3.24,3.58]},{"text":"Jobs later stated that getting fired was the best thing for him.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","M","S","S","V","C","C","C","M","M"],"dur":3.84,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.26,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.56,1.08,1.26,1.5,1.98,2.4,2.54,2.84,3.18,3.52]},{"text":"Apple bought NeXT in 1997, so Jobs returned to his original firm.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.92,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":6.62,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.5,0.9,1.1,2.7,2.8,3.0,3.38,3.86,3.98,4.34]},{"text":"People will remember him because he saved Apple from going broke.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","M","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":4.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.13,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.4,0.72,1.08,1.48,1.68,2.02,2.38,2.76,2.96]}],"bands":{"core1000":89,"core1800":3,"ngsl":2,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":3,"focus":"getting fired","title":"Gerund as Clause Subject","note":"Adding '-ing' turns a verb into a noun called a gerund. Here, the passive gerund phrase 'getting fired' acts as the subject of the inner clause."},{"i":5,"focus":"because he saved Apple","title":"Adverbial Clause of Cause","note":"The subordinate conjunction 'because' introduces an adverbial clause. It clarifies the reason why people will remember him."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Steve Jobs co-founded Apple in 1976 to build and sell personal computers.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.69,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":8.99,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.78,1.66,1.98,2.38,3.36,4.26,4.56,4.88,5.24,5.68]},{"text":"However, a major power struggle with executive leaders forced him out in 1985.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-1.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.89,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.28,"times":[0.0,0.48,0.58,1.0,1.32,1.86,2.12,2.34,3.1,3.7,3.98,4.18,4.44]},{"text":"Jobs quickly started a platform firm, which creates core computing systems, called NeXT.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","S","V","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.69,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.64,1.18,1.46,1.8,2.86,2.92,3.28,3.7,4.24,5.24,5.48]},{"text":"He also purchased a computer graphics unit that became the successful animation studio Pixar.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":5.86,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.17,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.38,0.78,1.04,1.32,1.8,2.34,2.8,3.04,3.28,3.74,4.14,4.94]},{"text":"Jobs later reflected that being fired from Apple was actually beneficial for his career.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","M","S","S","S","S","V","M","C","M","M","M"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":7.07,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.6,1.1,1.52,1.8,2.26,2.58,2.88,3.46,3.88,4.32,4.92,5.06]},{"text":"In 1997, Apple acquired NeXT, which enabled Jobs to return as chief executive officer.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","S","V","O","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.6,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.78,"times":[0.0,0.08,1.5,1.88,2.5,3.3,3.46,3.66,4.08,4.42,4.74,5.14,5.44,5.94]},{"text":"He has remained famous because his leadership saved Apple from near financial failure.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","C","M","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":6.7,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.26,0.52,1.08,1.66,1.94,2.36,3.04,3.4,3.8,4.1,4.42]}],"bands":{"core1000":76,"core1800":13,"ngsl":5,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":4},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"to build and sell personal computers","title":"Infinitive Phrase of Purpose","note":"An infinitive phrase starting with 'to' expresses intent or purpose. It tells the reader why the action of co-founding took place."},{"i":6,"focus":"has remained","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The auxiliary 'has' combined with past participle 'remained' forms the present perfect tense. It indicates a state that started in the past and persists into the present."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, Steve Jobs co-founded Apple to market early personal computers alongside partner Steve Wozniak.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.66,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.97,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.42,2.26,2.62,3.42,3.78,4.2,4.5,4.86,5.26,5.94,6.76,7.34,7.74]},{"text":"Following an intense power struggle with the board of directors, Jobs was forced out of Apple in 1985.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":7.33,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.56,0.94,1.4,1.9,2.16,2.24,2.46,2.58,3.54,3.82,4.12,4.36,4.76,4.9,5.18,5.42]},{"text":"That same year, Jobs established NeXT, a software and hardware platform developer for education and business markets.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.62,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":9.01,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.36,1.1,1.38,2.02,3.12,3.3,3.68,3.96,4.26,4.86,5.2,5.68,6.1,6.54,6.88]},{"text":"Shortly afterward, he purchased Lucasfilm's computer graphics division, which subsequently operated as the independent animation studio Pixar.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.78,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":10.65,"times":[0.0,0.16,1.3,1.34,1.64,2.66,3.0,3.48,4.46,4.6,5.04,5.68,6.04,6.16,6.64,7.12,7.86]},{"text":"Jobs later remarked that getting fired had actually been the best event for his personal development.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","M","S","S","V","M","V","C","C","C","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.64,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.79,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.56,1.0,1.34,1.58,2.02,2.44,2.76,3.08,3.24,3.54,3.92,4.26,4.4,4.8]},{"text":"Apple ultimately acquired NeXT in 1997, which allowed Jobs to rejoin his original company as chief executive officer.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","M","M","S","V","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":7.97,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":10.71,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.8,1.26,1.86,2.06,3.7,3.74,3.92,4.2,4.52,5.06,5.3,5.44,6.2,6.54,6.82,7.34]},{"text":"He successfully revived Apple from the verge of bankruptcy by creating groundbreaking products like the iPhone.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.71,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.34,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.46,1.06,1.48,1.84,1.94,2.12,2.3,2.66,3.4,3.76,4.22,5.0,5.48,5.64]}],"bands":{"core1000":68,"core1800":11,"ngsl":7,"tsl":7,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"was forced","title":"Passive Voice","note":"Using 'was' plus the past participle 'forced' creates a passive structure. This shifts attention to Jobs as the recipient of the action rather than the board."},{"i":4,"focus":"had actually been","title":"Past Perfect Tense","note":"The past perfect construction 'had been' expresses an action or state completed prior to a specific point in the past. Here, it refers to his experience before he later remarked on it."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"When Steve Jobs was ousted from Apple in 1985 following a power struggle, at age thirty, he immediately began a new chapter.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":9.15,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":10.76,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.64,0.9,1.34,1.72,2.18,2.48,2.8,3.44,4.2,4.38,4.56,5.42,5.46,5.64,6.68,6.78,7.34,7.8,8.14,8.4]},{"text":"The technology pioneer later stated that being terminated by the company he co-founded was the best thing that could have happened to him.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t5-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","M","V","M","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","C","C","C","S","V","V","V","M","M"],"dur":7.76,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":9.9,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.36,0.88,1.42,1.82,2.08,2.42,2.9,3.44,3.56,3.9,4.08,4.74,5.38,5.56,5.96,6.34,6.6,6.78,6.88,7.22,7.38]},{"text":"Unhindered by his sudden departure, Jobs founded NeXT that same year to develop computer platforms for higher education and corporate enterprise markets.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.27,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":11.06,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.7,0.86,1.1,2.12,2.28,2.84,3.52,3.9,4.12,4.44,4.76,5.0,5.46,5.92,6.32,6.6,7.14,7.62,7.96,8.34]},{"text":"In 1986, he bought the computer graphics division of Lucasfilm, which was spun off into an independent animation company named Pixar.","voice":"voice/2026-11-05-apps-steve-jobs-returned-to/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","S","V","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.29,"voiceJa":"voice/202